BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-08-29T05:27:00&endDate=2026-08-30T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nMetropolitan Line: No service between Harrow-on-the-Hill and Aldgate and SEVERE DELAYS on the rest of the line while emergency services respond to a large fire near the railway at Neasden. Tickets will be accepted on London Buses\, Lioness line\, London Northwestern and Thameslink services. Service is not expected to resume fully until 18:00 today at the earliest. Please check before you travel. 
